## rules.yaml
briefing =
    Establish your base, then build and defend the Temple of Nod.
    All GDI forces are to be destroyed. Kane has ordered you to defend
    the Temple at all costs, even your own life. Do not allow GDI forces
    to overrun you.

## lua
build-temple = Construct the Temple of Nod.
destroy-gdi-communications-center = Destroy the GDI Communications Center in the central outpost to stop the airstrikes.
destroy-gdi-west-communications-center = Destroy the GDI Communications Center in the western base to stop their reinforcements.
destroy-gdi-advanced-communications-center = Destroy the GDI Advanced Communications Center to stop the Ion Cannon.
ion-cannon-online = Warning: the GDI Ion Cannon is now online.
airstrikes-stopped = The GDI Communications Center in the central outpost has been destroyed. Their airstrikes have stopped.
west-reinforcements-stopped = The GDI Communications Center in the western base has been destroyed. Their reinforcements have stopped.
ion-cannon-offline = The GDI Advanced Communications Center has been destroyed. Their Ion Cannon is offline.
reinforcements-south = Nod reinforcements have arrived in the south. Deploy the MCV and establish a second base.
reinforcements-chinook = A transport helicopter is available at the eastern coast.